 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u24895",
   "en": "Every piece of equipment you have not already assigned to a squad member is available on the inventory screen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24896",
   "en": "There are equipment lockers for every member of your crew in the cargo bay of the Normandy. These allow you to change current equipped weapons, armor, and upgrades for each squad member.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24897",
   "en": "Hammerhead ammunition does little damage, can knock targets down. Use it to keep enemies on the floor and helpless.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24898",
   "en": "Drive diagonally up steep slopes in the mako, using switchback turns to traverse difficult terrain.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24899",
   "en": "While driving the mako, press [XBoxB_Btn_Y] to repair any damage it may have sustained. This uses omnigel.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24900",
   "en": "You can set your own destination waypoint on your Map by pressing [UI_XBoxB_Btn_A]. This waypoint will show up on your radar. Note: you can only have one active waypoint on any given map.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24901",
   "en": "Your radar will show the direction to a destination waypoint set on your map. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_A] on the Map screen to set a destination waypoint.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24902",
   "en": "You can only have one destination waypoint set on a map at any given time. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_A] on the Map screen to set a destination waypoint.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24903",
   "en": "Your Specialization Class will replace your base class in the Talents on the SQUAD screen.\nTalent Ranks in your base class transfer over to your Specialization Class.\nGo to your SQUAD screen to view the bonuses you gain with each rank in your Specialization Class.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
